{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27e1\u02d9\u22c6<strong>Join a cozy online community, where every conversation matters.\u00a0</strong>\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OdiChat is a narrative-driven visual novel that takes place on a chat simulator. Meet people from different backgrounds as they share their stories and talk about life, love, and the small things that connect us all.\u2661 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Whether you're sharing secrets, offering support\u2014or being more than a little flirty\u2014every choice shapes the bond you form with each group member. \u2606<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/e99e4e0d4af2f86e1e2ecd0b73728ee9.avif?t=1755973914\" width=600 height=175 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u27e1\u02d9\u22c6\u00a0<strong>Features\u00a0</strong>\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Chats and videocalls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a welcoming and lively online community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f08cd241567de67df13938595630d57f.poster.avif?t=1755973914\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f08cd241567de67df13938595630d57f.webm?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f08cd241567de67df13938595630d57f.mp4?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf08 Diverse characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each member has unique dreams, struggles, and personality! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/cfac9c7f694b4dcb8e9329fb233f547b.poster.avif?t=1755973914\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/cfac9c7f694b4dcb8e9329fb233f547b.webm?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/cfac9c7f694b4dcb8e9329fb233f547b.mp4?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc97 Three different endings per love interest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each love interest has three endings: General, Friendship and Lovers! Romance is always optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcab Branching choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every answer shifts the direction of the chats, unlocking new scenes, content and endings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/3fc6d88fce66605c6ab66bc63dd11ccd.poster.avif?t=1755973914\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/3fc6d88fce66605c6ab66bc63dd11ccd.webm?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/3fc6d88fce66605c6ab66bc63dd11ccd.mp4?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 Lo-fi vibes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and chill with lo-fi beats and a cozy UI \u266a <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f8d3991e4dce77c01d08af2a9ae6d91f.poster.avif?t=1755973914\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f8d3991e4dce77c01d08af2a9ae6d91f.webm?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/f8d3991e4dce77c01d08af2a9ae6d91f.mp4?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf43 Customize your profile!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your name, pronouns, and profile picture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/46e75881291af7b9f911ab0e93c4de32.poster.avif?t=1755973914\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/46e75881291af7b9f911ab0e93c4de32.webm?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/extras/46e75881291af7b9f911ab0e93c4de32.mp4?t=1755973914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474280?t=1755973914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755973914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755973914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755973914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"F